  "title": "How Your Eyes See | Full Video for Kids",
  "cover_text": "EYE-MAZING!",
  "description": "Find out how your eyes see: how light gets in through the pupil, how the lens makes a picture on the retina, why that picture is upside down, and how your brain flips it. Plus a thumb trick and a quiz! Leo asks, big sister Mia explains.\n\nWant the 60-second version? Find it on our Shorts tab.\n\nThe CurioKids Club: short, curious answers to kids' big questions. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@CurioKidsClub",
